WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:01.770
(kookaburra laughing)

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.667
- What in the world is that,
it's like a gremlin got out.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.598
- It's the kookaburra!

00:00:06.598 --> 00:00:07.730
- It's a kookaburra, I can't
say with your cool accent.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.240
- I can do it, I actually
practiced doing him last.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.870
- Wait, can you harmonize with that?

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:14.503
If we played it, could you
harmonize with the kookaburra?

00:00:14.503 --> 00:00:15.420
- Mm, yeah.

00:00:16.932 --> 00:00:18.350
- Okay, Robert, Bindi, can
you bring the bird out?

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.503
I'm gonna harmonize with Kristin.

00:00:20.503 --> 00:00:23.085
(audience applause)
- We're gonna harmonize.

00:00:23.085 --> 00:00:23.985
We're gonna do it.

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:26.726
We can do it.
- This is so exciting!

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:27.593
- Hey, y'all!

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:28.834
- So good to see you, how you doing?

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:30.833
- Look it's my size!
(Robert laughs)

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:31.947
- All right, he might
not make a sound now.

00:00:31.947 --> 00:00:34.420
But, hey can we play it?

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.083
We're gonna try, this is the sound.

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:37.695
- This is it, okay.

00:00:37.695 --> 00:00:41.409
(kookaburra calling)

00:00:41.409 --> 00:00:46.409
(Kristin coos)
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:50.552 --> 00:00:52.360
- [Bindi] I love you!
(Kristin coos)

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.988
- He doesn't know what to think.

00:00:53.988 --> 00:00:56.611
- This is like most of my
boyfriends, they're scared of me.

